Z||000019||Elvira||11-29-2001||08:39 AM||||How many coats of clear did you put on? <P>I put 4 coats on of Dupli-Color high temp clear.  My valve covers are already done and on the car and I have had NO problems with the clear or the color.  I am putting the plenum on tomorrow (Friday) and will post pics of it this weekend.  Make sure to use high temp primer under the paint.<P>------------------<BR>Elvira<BR>Blue 87GT<BR>Black 86GT 5sp x 2<BR>86SC t-top 58k miles<BR>84 Indy<BR>87 4-seater||||reg||1
