Z||000022||Black86SE||11-29-2001||06:30 PM||||I am using the dupli-color paint also. I had a coat of primer on and so far only one coat of clear. I am having FieroJoe paint my stuff cause I suck at painting. I will have him put a couple of more coats on. So far I am pleased with the paint. Although I only have the lower plenum painted so it is hard to see any imperfections, but once the plenum is painted I hope it comes out perfect. Plus we are gonna polish the fins on the valve covers and plenum and then clear coat it. I just have to think of what the sticker should say that I put on the plenum. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Black86SEsig_1.gif"> <BR>Black 1986 SE V6<BR>Automatic - 5-speed soon!<BR>17" Motegi MR7 Wheels<BR>P235/45/ZR17 <BR>BF Goodrich g-Force KDWS<BR>AIM ScreenName: Black86se||||reg||1
